    "price_level": 3,
    "rating": 3.9,
    "reference": "ChIJ53yZ2ENIyUwR9fqmzbwjh68",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Daniela Marks",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117853414141831176731/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6Bc9qrZw7o00mmgvvoaWy68Z1Q_yAUX9zvLS6bQ4z3RZV_IaqmA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "This is an awesome party place. The food is variable. We were there with large party and had a set menu. The escargot and the shrimp were amazing. The salad was mediocre, the chicken cacciatore was really good.\nThe life DJ clued in quickly to which music made the crowd hop and put on a great party. It was a somewhat nice night (Montreal in June, it is comme ci comme ça ) but they have an upstairs terrace and opened the space underneath it up as a dance floor, and it is fabulous and accommodates a lot of people.\nThe drinks are really good and not skimpy in either quality or quantity. So all over I would definitely recommend this for any size party, although it is a bit out of the way.",
        "time": 1560705124,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Frank Maiore",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116286682801558513838/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKZbRcZ05Z8Fw5glTiD6eUmpL3EuBa00ryBtKna9UeASmeNyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "The place has a good vibe, the steak was very good,  but terrible presentation, my plate was spattered with oil/butter which made it looked dirty, the waiter should have never served that plate to a client, also only the steak on the plate, nothing else, the fries were cold had to be returned.\n\nOur waiter was not attentive in any way, never asked if all was ok, we were left in a corner and forgotten about, never came back once to check on us, never offered coffee, dessert.\n\nI had to run around the place to get our bill, too bad nice place,  but due to terrible service and poor presentation would not return.",
        "time": 1566054603,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gio Gio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101386990042434778757/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXGm9WOw5JDcwAnz-_cVqmslriqb311vgEGM7B0nyzQ7dDbibHPQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Overall the ambiance is nice and the food was tasty from entrees to main course and dessert.\nUnfortunately the service was lacking and perhaps that was due to an excessively noisy table of what seemed to be adults acting as teenagers.\nIt's unfortunate because many of the patrons were displeased yet the management didn't do much and unless they do they will continue to attract kids in adult clothing.\nWorth a try or better yet go to the cozy cafe, that place is hip trendy and classy sans the fools.",
        "time": 1560657158,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nat S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105456326833803556695/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbhNa5dqWy4qvAcYY7nxPDTacZkv_bHEWFkiFmlBWWzeszIg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Decor had a high-end vibe with leather finishes and modern feel. Atmosphere  to put customers at ease and well attended.  Music not too loud so my husband and I could have a conversation.  Live music later on was very good where you could still talk and hear your companion. Good happy hour specials. Michele, our waitress, was excellent. Manager and owner were also very attentive and we weren't spending a lot of money. It's just that they were giving good service. We will be back and we will bring our friends.",
        "time": 1489800401,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paul",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102499771162626804395/reviews",
